**Q9. Display the grade of JONES (based on salary range).**
```sql
SELECT ename, sal,
       CASE
           WHEN sal BETWEEN  700 AND 1200 THEN 1
           WHEN sal BETWEEN 1201 AND 1400 THEN 2
           WHEN sal BETWEEN 1401 AND 2000 THEN 3
